      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Boundaries",
      "items": [
        "One operator, one machine; the model only as the claude CLI on PATH",
        "The listener is the one daemon (ADR-0001); the rest runs foreground, started to look",
        "* facts about transcripts, never their text — except a failed call's result text (ADR-0027)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Writers and readers",
      "items": [
        "Two writers, the analysis run and the listener, serialise on WAL; the server reads mode=ro",
        "Migrations run in the analysis run's init_db; v9 rescans surviving transcripts"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "What is public",
      "items": [
        "Born public: local-data/ and real transcripts never enter git",
        "A pre-commit denylist refuses home paths, key shapes, transcript filenames"
      ]
    }
